Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:03.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A-Acrobatic Silky?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.31,0:00:06.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:09.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Takakura-sama, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.53,0:00:10.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:13.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What a lewd state you are in!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.57,0:00:16.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,To expose yourself to me like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:18.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It must mean you're presuming\Na betrothal already!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.95,0:00:20.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:22.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You have powers as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:27.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I see, so that is why you were able\Nto enter our void space.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:29.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We will take your banana organs\Nwhile we're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Labor, labor...\N- Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.51,0:00:32.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let me put something on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.92,0:00:35.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Takakura-sama, I will deal with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.47,0:00:39.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Full of defects, covered in mud,\Nthat's fine, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.10,0:00:42.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yup, that's fine, that's fine, now...\NLabor!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.94,0:00:47.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Serpoian Form Serpogrammetry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.90,0:00:52.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.03,0:00:55.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't include me in your attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.45,0:00:58.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're a cheap hire. There are\Ncountless replacements for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.70,0:01:00.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}What was that just now?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.12,0:01:02.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I feel like I crashed into an invisible wall.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.12,0:01:05.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.16,0:01:08.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Chiquitita, you have a dream?\NShy my chotchiki for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.29,0:01:09.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Chiquitita, you wake from a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.71,0:01:11.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Shy my chotchiki for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.21,0:01:13.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.01,0:01:14.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.51,0:01:17.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Where are the clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.47,0:01:19.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Jet Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:26.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's a respectable punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.64,0:01:28.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thank you, deez!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:32.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But if it doesn't connect,\Nit's not much of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.32,0:01:34.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:36.86,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,TAKAKURA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.61,0:01:39.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Serpoian Form Serpogrammetry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.99,0:01:41.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold it! Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.49,0:01:42.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What a nuisance!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:46.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You seem to be in love with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.33,0:01:47.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Not one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:51.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I already have\Nsomeone in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.92,0:01:55.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But I'll give you as many chances\Nas you need to try to win my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:57.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.43,0:02:02.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,...the conditions of an attractive lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:05.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Argh! My head is stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.35,0:02:07.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Now, I'll take the nuisance...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.69,0:02:14.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I have caught you, woman person.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.32,0:02:16.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What is this? It's going to crush me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.65,0:02:22.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You just thought, "You can use psychic powers\Neven without saying Serpogrammetry," yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.20,0:02:23.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't care about any of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.53,0:02:27.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I didn't overlook the fact\Nthat you dropped your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.29,0:02:29.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't care about that!\NJust let me out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:31.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But this is quite interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:35.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There are multiple persons with special powers\Nin the same location.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:38.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There is hope for us\Nto seek further evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:41.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Your movements are remarkable...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:43.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,...but you are not all too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:48.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This wasn't in the plans, but we will take\Nyour banana organs as well while we're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.43,0:02:52.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I am the chosen one!\NI won't lose to the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.23,0:02:53.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The light of hope will come\Nfrom the heavens and—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.56,0:02:54.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Chiquitita.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.07,0:03:06.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's right. You have been chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.29,0:03:08.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Chosen for our evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.33,0:03:09.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Now, let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.91,0:03:11.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on just a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.80,0:03:27.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You were after me, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.35,0:03:31.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll take you on right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.52,0:03:34.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Takakura-sama! You're still...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.98,0:03:38.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There are things that are\Nmore important than clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.66,0:03:49.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Man, I hate this. I wanna go home...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:53.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's right, that's right.\NWe want your banana organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.54,0:03:55.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:03:57.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We can do both of you simultaneously.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:04:00.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,As long as there are three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:02.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.93,0:04:05.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The transformation is wearing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:09.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is possible when the three of us\Ncombine our psychokinesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:11.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The Awesome Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.69,0:04:13.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Inside this area...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.81,0:04:14.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,...all transformations...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.98,0:04:16.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,...let alone standing up...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:17.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,...will be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.57,0:04:18.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- However...\N- ...this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.90,0:04:20.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- ...has...\N- ...one...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.19,0:04:21.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,...flaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.57,0:04:24.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We cannot enter there, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:25.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thus...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.03,0:04:32.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We will have him beat you up\Nuntil you can no longer move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:35.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop that! If you do that, he'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.71,0:04:37.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:52.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.81,0:04:54.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He broke through the Awesome Zone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:04:55.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No, he didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:59.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Our psychokinesis\Nis being repelled by someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:01.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh no! The woman person is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:04.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo-chan, I really missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.61,0:05:05.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.91,0:05:08.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't you be making out with that bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.37,0:05:12.45,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'd never forget your damn faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.93,0:06:54.81,BD Bottom Left,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,{\fs16.666667\pos(23.333333,341.666667)}EPISODE 9\NMERGE!\NSERPO DOVER DEMON NESSIE!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.47,0:06:52.80,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo-chan, I really missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.80,0:06:55.14,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Shut up! Don't look at me, you perv!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.22,0:06:57.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Until we harvest\Nthe man person's banana organ...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.52,0:07:00.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,...we wanted the woman person\Nunder confinement! That's what we told it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.73,0:07:02.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What exactly is that thing doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.56,0:07:06.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's annoying that Momo Ayase is rescuing me,\Nbut I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:07.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You shall lend us a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.61,0:07:09.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, is that Acro-Silky?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.11,0:07:12.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll help you out, but I won't let you\Nhave Ken Takakura-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.37,0:07:15.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.53,0:07:17.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on, Momo Ayase!\NWhat are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.75,0:07:19.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You have to hold them back\Nwith your magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.83,0:07:22.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't know how,\Nbut we have the advantage!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.33,0:07:25.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's wake up the Gig Worker now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:28.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn it! Do your job properly\Nor we'll lower your pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.26,0:07:30.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sorry, this is a bit impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.63,0:07:33.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're such a bother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:35.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No! Anything but that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.39,0:07:38.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.81,0:07:43.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yellow and black\Nis the mark of courage.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:47.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you able to fight 24 hours?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.11,0:07:51.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Regain, Regain, our own Regain.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.15,0:07:55.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}The mark of courage on our briefcases.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.37,0:07:59.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can you fight far off in a distant world?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.20,0:08:00.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Business Man!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.12,0:08:03.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Business Man!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.17,0:08:06.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Japanese Business Man!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.93,0:08:13.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.68,0:08:14.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Take them...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.43,0:08:15.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,...and beat them up...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:17.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,...so they can't move anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:21.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Man, you irritate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.52,0:08:26.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You mention that name, you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:27.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.57,0:08:29.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Our psychic powers are being pushed back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:33.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Gig Worker! Go after that woman person!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.40,0:08:37.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I won't let you.\NYou're not going to ignore me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.20,0:08:38.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Makes me wilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.62,0:08:42.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If we don't have that\Npsychic thing going, it's all ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:43.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Salary...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.25,0:08:44.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Uppercut!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:48.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't see the attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.63,0:08:49.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That thing is bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.59,0:08:51.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Mantis!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.47,0:08:55.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He dodged!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.76,0:08:58.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can see this thing's punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.85,0:08:59.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Mantis!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:07.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You said that I am lacking in power,\Ndidn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.44,0:09:11.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:15.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll simply nail\Nyour weak spot multiple times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.78,0:09:18.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I am one with Takakura-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.07,0:09:20.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey! You guys are way too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.08,0:09:22.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You guys will both get blown away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.16,0:09:23.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh my, are you jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:24.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,As if!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.33,0:09:26.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo-chan, that's great advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:28.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I am an awkward fellow after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.21,0:09:31.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you guys wanna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.75,0:09:33.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.05,0:09:34.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on, get a grip already!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.59,0:09:37.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're the one in charge of holding back\Ntheir weird powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.22,0:09:39.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sheesh, you are so useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.55,0:09:42.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Your pay will be cut by 60 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:44.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,N-No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.49,0:10:02.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What was that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.24,0:10:04.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:05.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My feet don't touch the bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.45,0:10:07.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:14.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The wall and ceiling is all water now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.47,0:10:22.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.52,0:10:32.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.07,0:10:38.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Crap, crap, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:39.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We're gonna escape for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.82,0:10:43.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on! Why are you calling the shots?\NI'm the leader here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:44.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's Nessie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:47.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Takakura-kun is getting excited.\NHe's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.16,0:10:48.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:51.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No, we're in Kamigoe City,\Nso should I call it Kamissie?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:54.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, fine! Then you guys can get\Nreal chummy and stare at Nessie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.67,0:10:55.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.63,0:10:58.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, so that thing is called Nessie?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.22,0:11:00.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Takakura-kun, you know so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.13,0:11:02.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on! What have you been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:05.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You weren't able to hold back\Nthe woman person at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.35,0:11:07.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're also getting a 60 percent pay cu...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.19,0:11:16.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.19,0:11:17.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Nessie is really bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.40,0:11:19.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Why are you attacking us?\N- That's what I've been saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.74,0:11:21.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're supposed to get\Nthat woman person over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:23.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey! Takakura-kun, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.24,0:11:28.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Shiratori!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.75,0:11:31.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That was from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.92,0:11:33.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Business Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.46,0:11:37.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Does he punch harder underwater?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.00,0:11:40.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Is he a Mantisian that has\Nthe characteristics of a mantis shrimp?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:41.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Mantis! Mantis!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.51,0:11:46.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yours truly can exert\Nreal power underwater!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.76,0:11:49.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The underwater punching power\Nof yours truly is ten times that on land.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.81,0:11:52.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.48,0:11:59.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ten times!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:01.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Still need air, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.57,0:12:02.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.16,0:12:06.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You should be able to swim at pretty high speed\Nwith Turbo Granny's leg strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.95,0:12:08.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Makes me wilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:15.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:17.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:19.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Turbo Granny can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.05,0:12:20.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.30,0:12:27.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is the worst situation ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:29.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to fight like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.68,0:12:31.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't know the answer either!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.48,0:12:33.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We're in trouble if we take too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:35.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If we don't hurry up and save\Nthat stupid girl, she'll drown!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.48,0:12:37.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, what about your psychic powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.19,0:12:39.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can reach if we're right below her,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:41.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,but that mantis shrimp guy\Nis in the way and I can't get close!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.69,0:12:43.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then I'll draw that guy's attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:45.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,so please grab Miss Shiratori\Nin the meantime!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.74,0:12:47.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.03,0:12:50.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you just plunge in like that, you'll end up\Nexactly like that stupid girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:52.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't make things harder for me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.25,0:12:53.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You don't have to say it like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:56.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to make myself useful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.33,0:12:58.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And it doesn't mean jack\Nif you cause even more trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:00.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's why I said we need to hurry up and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:02.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You guys are at fault\Nfor making out all the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.92,0:13:04.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We weren't making out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.05,0:13:06.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You've been making out!\NThis whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.18,0:13:08.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You pinned her down on the ground\Nin the courtyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.22,0:13:09.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So it was bothering you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.85,0:13:10.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No, it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.97,0:13:14.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't care what some liar\Nis doing with some stupid girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.31,0:13:15.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.06,0:13:20.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you actually care,\Nthen tell me honestly that you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.40,0:13:25.03,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If it's weighing on your mind,\Nplease let me explain myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.40,0:13:28.70,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't care how much other people\Nwill take things the wrong way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.87,0:13:31.54,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,but I don't want you\Nto have the wrong idea, Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.54,0:13:34.62,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I want you to have a proper understanding\Nof everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.37,0:13:39.08,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't touch me, pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.08,0:13:40.34,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:42.30,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How can you say that\Nwhen you look like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.67,0:13:43.55,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:03.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!\NThat was beyond my control!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.15,0:14:04.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I won't touch you ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.69,0:14:05.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.90,0:14:06.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:08.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, stay still!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.95,0:14:09.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.03,0:14:11.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.83,0:14:13.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All right, let's try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.79,0:14:16.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop with your futile resistance!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.25,0:14:19.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.71,0:14:23.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I grab Okarun really hard,\Nand push him forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.09,0:14:28.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I propel him with my psychic powers\Nas if I'm catching a lively fish, and ride it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.47,0:14:33.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You can't escape attacks from yours truly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.68,0:14:36.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Get up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.07,0:14:52.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.37,0:14:53.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, you're such a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:55.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:14:57.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, come on. Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.16,0:15:00.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She probably swallowed a lot of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.58,0:15:02.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't hate me for this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.33,0:15:03.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Forced resuscitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:06.17,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Shiratori! I'm glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:09.88,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Is this a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.88,0:15:12.64,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You dumbass!\NWe haven't resolved anything yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.64,0:15:15.39,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Take your clothes off! It's hard to move you\Nwhen there's water resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.39,0:15:16.06,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.06,0:15:18.68,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I've already decided I'm not stripping down\Nuntil my wedding night!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.68,0:15:19.77,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Strip!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:25.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's not fair that you escaped upwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.77,0:15:29.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, right now yours truly\Nhas them cornered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.61,0:15:32.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Give me a bit more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.45,0:15:36.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.58,0:15:39.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Each and every one of you are useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.41,0:15:44.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,His attack power is amazing, but he's so stupid\Nhe assaults everything in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.59,0:15:47.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Gig Worker has high attack power underwater,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.71,0:15:50.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,but he takes too many breaths\Nand the enemy ends up escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.72,0:15:52.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.05,0:15:55.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's enough. This is a case\Nwhere we will all merge together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.55,0:15:58.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We will use this Body Cable to become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.97,0:16:01.69,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,YOU MUST ASSUME RESPONSIBILITY\NAND RAISE AN ANIMAL FOR ITS ENTIRE LIFE!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:01.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You have to assume responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:04.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Takakura-kun, you saw me in lingerie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.77,0:16:05.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.61,0:16:08.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You in lingerie is only worth\None piece of candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:11.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Anyway, I need both of you\Nto get fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.40,0:16:14.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We can't win unless we all use\Neverything we've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.11,0:16:14.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.74,0:16:17.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't tell me what to do!\NI'm the leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:18.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:20.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.27,0:16:46.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What a shame. Ran out of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.03,0:16:51.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.49,0:16:54.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What was that?\NIs that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.45,0:16:59.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, look at that!\NIt's pooling water into its neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.04,0:17:01.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So it can't shoot continuously!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:06.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Which means, if we break that thing's neck,\Nit can't shoot lasers anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.08,0:17:07.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:10.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Now might be our chance!\NLet's get close and attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.06,0:17:32.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You just thought we only had\Nthe high-compression water blast, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.03,0:17:37.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We may look like this, but we are\Na close-combat in-fighter UMA.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:41.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh no!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.26,0:17:56.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, get a grip! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.51,0:18:01.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That hurt! I'm not okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.06,0:18:02.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then you're fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.77,0:18:05.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That thing has the punching guy's arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.81,0:18:09.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,When did they merge together?\NWe can't get close like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.27,0:18:14.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That damn Serpoian brought the punching guy\Nto cover for Nessie's weakness all along!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.07,0:18:17.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's too strong! Laser beams\Nand mantis shrimp punches...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.95,0:18:21.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We might've had a chance on land,\Nbut there's nothing we can do underwater!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.37,0:18:22.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, what'd you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.91,0:18:24.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:25.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Not that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.41,0:18:27.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You said mantis shrimp punches?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.55,0:18:42.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.76,0:18:46.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The high-compression water blast\Nhas run out yet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.23,0:18:50.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But we have endless ways to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:55.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You are a very dangerous person,\Nso we will kill you first then dissect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:59.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We can simply wait for you to drown\Nbut we have used a bit too much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.91,0:19:02.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Can we punch you to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.84,0:19:21.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.55,0:19:22.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.14,0:19:27.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have merged together\Nwith that Mantisian.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:30.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A mantis shrimp's punching powers\Nare unparalleled underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.85,0:19:34.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But on land, it can never\Nunleash a punch at full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.11,0:19:35.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Including him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.90,0:19:38.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If he tried to go all-out,\Nhe'd have ended up like you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.03,0:19:42.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He'd have imploded\Nfrom the impact of his own punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:51.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can stay underwater like this\Nfor hours on end!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:54.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.96,0:20:00.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Will you drown first? Or will you be severed\Nby the high-compression water blast first?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.52,0:20:11.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:14.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But if there's a path to run...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.73,0:20:16.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can go full throttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.27,0:20:18.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on just a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.53,0:21:08.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We're back?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:12.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We defeated them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.75,0:21:20.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The ground is hard.\NThis is the hallway!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.50,0:21:22.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thank you, hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.09,0:21:25.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thank you for being so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.84,0:21:28.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.18,0:21:32.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I dunno. It's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.68,0:21:34.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.35,0:21:35.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.85,0:21:38.73,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,These guys are buck naked and hugging!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.28,0:21:44.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ayase from Class B\Nand that four-eyes is going at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.78,0:21:46.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.36,0:21:49.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.53,0:21:52.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The prim Miss Shiratori\Nfrom Class D is naked, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.08,0:21:54.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.37,0:21:56.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why are they all naked?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.51,0:23:28.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Nessie was simply too wicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.97,0:23:30.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Was it a surviving Plesiosaur?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.63,0:23:33.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But I never thought\Nit would merge with an alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.14,0:23:35.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The merger between an UMA and an alien\Nis like a dream for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.47,0:23:36.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Takakura-kun, you know so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.89,0:23:39.35,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 10\NHAVE YOU EVER SEEN A CATTLE MUTILATION?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.10,0:23:39.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Next episode,\N"Have You Ever Seen a Cattle Mutilation?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.35,0:23:41.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Man, I was caught in a weird situation.\NThis really sucks!
